       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Metformin 1700 mg three times daily comes to 5,100 mg/day. That is double the labeled maximum daily dose of 2,550 mg for immediate-release metformin in adults. Normal kidney and liver function doesn't change that limit.\n\nHere are some options:\n- **Standard titrated dosing:** 500 mg twice daily or 850 mg once daily with meals, increased gradually.\n- **Maximum IR dose:** 850 mg three times daily with meals, which is 2,550 mg/day.\n- **Total of 1,700 mg/day:** 850 mg twice daily with meals. If you meant 1,700 mg as the daily total, this may be what you want.\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want, and I'll enter it right away."
